  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "-The ability to select which rule the user broke during warning/kicking/banning\n\n(This can be done if rules were implemented in a list based format instead of one big box of rules)\n\n-The ability for world owners to choose specific groups to have moderation perms in every instance of that world\n\n(This would be good for general public instances where there aren't any moderators at all)\n\n-The ability to see a list of kicked users of an instance, so you can remove people who have been wrongfully kicked and let them back in",
